{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
  "全文已就绪": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Full article ready"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "显示全文并回到文章开头": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Show the full article and return to the beginning"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "文章正文": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Article Content"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "自动抓取网页全文": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Automatically Fetch Full Articles"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "关闭后，阅读与 AI 使用订阅源正文或已有缓存，不自动抓取原网页全文。图片仍可能联网加载，也可手动重新抓取正文。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "When off, reading and AI use feed content or cached articles without automatically fetching the original page. Images may still load online, and you can manually fetch the article again."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "同步未读文章正文": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Sync unread article content"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "收藏文章始终同步；开启后在多台设备间同步未读文章全文。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Starred articles always sync; enable to sync full unread content across your devices."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "已与 iCloud 保持同步": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Up to date with iCloud"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "高级与云端维护选项": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Advanced & Cloud Maintenance Options"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "云端记录与维护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Cloud Records & Maintenance"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "资料恢复与重置": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Data Recovery & Reset"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "复制订阅到 iCloud…": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Copy Subscriptions to iCloud…"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "重新启用将沿用原授权、任务编号和等待时间。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Re-enabling preserves the original consent, task identifiers and retry wait."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "本次确认包含以后符合条件的文章，请单独审阅这一范围。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This consent includes future eligible articles. Review that scope separately."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "本次复核确认 %lld 项，仍无法确认 %lld 项，另有 %lld 项待复核。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This review confirmed %lld operations, could not confirm %lld, and has %lld more to review."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "维护范围": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Maintenance Scope"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "本次有限任务": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This Finite Task"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "持续自动维护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Ongoing Automatic Maintenance"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "复核只读取原请求的云端证据；未能确认的原操作仍保留，不重复删除。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review only reads cloud evidence for original requests. Unconfirmed operations are retained, and deletions are not repeated."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "只读复核原请求结果": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Read-Only Review of Original Outcomes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "持续检查当前 iCloud 资料范围，处理现在及以后符合 183 天规则的历史记录。每周共享额度最多 400 条，收藏、允许同步的未读正文和待同步修改受到保护；新设备可恢复的历史范围会缩短。本机文章和 AI 产物保留。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Continuously check this iCloud library for current and future records eligible under the 183-day rule. The shared weekly limit is 400 records. Stars, permitted unread content and pending changes are protected. New devices can recover less history. Local articles and AI results are retained."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "核验服务器时间需要额外控制保存，不计入上述 400 条历史清理额度。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Verifying server time requires extra control saves outside the 400-record history cleanup limit."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "关闭窗口会让已启用的维护继续运行。停用会阻止后续请求；已经提交的请求仍可能完成，原操作记录保留。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Enabled maintenance continues after closing this window. Disabling it stops subsequent requests. Already submitted requests may still finish, and their operation records are retained."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "持续维护已启用": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Ongoing Maintenance Enabled"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "当前任务有结果需要复核，暂不生成下一批任务。请停用后读取原请求结果。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The current task has outcomes needing review, so no new batch is created. Disable maintenance before reading the original request outcomes."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "下次发现时间：": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Next discovery:"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "停用持续维护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Disable Ongoing Maintenance"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "继续已启用的维护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Continue Enabled Maintenance"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "我确认历史清理会影响其他设备能够恢复的资料范围。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "I confirm that history cleanup affects what other devices can recover."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "我授权持续维护现在及以后的合格文章，直至主动停用。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "I authorize ongoing maintenance of current and future eligible articles until I disable it."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "我单独允许核验服务器时间所需的额外控制保存。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "I separately allow the extra control saves needed to verify server time."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "确认并启用持续维护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Confirm and Enable Ongoing Maintenance"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "审阅持续维护授权": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review Ongoing Maintenance Consent"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请分别确认历史恢复影响、以后文章的持续维护和额外时间控制保存。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Separately confirm the history recovery effects, ongoing maintenance of future articles and extra server-time control saves."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "持续维护授权已停用。请重新审阅并确认后继续，原任务记录仍保留。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Ongoing maintenance consent is disabled. Review and confirm before continuing. Original task records are retained."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "持续维护预览已过期或账号范围已变化，请重新核验。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The ongoing maintenance review expired or the account scope changed. Verify again."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "现有授权或任务仍在使用此范围，请先停用维护并查看任务进度。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Existing consent or a task is using this scope. Disable maintenance and review task progress first."
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "保留旧资料并准备新云库" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep Old Data and Prepare a New Cloud Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新云库从空资料开始，支持安全的云端历史清理。旧云资料区继续保留并占用 iCloud 空间；旧版本设备的同步将暂停，需要各自核验并恢复当前云库。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The replacement cloud library starts empty and supports safe cloud history cleanup. Previous cloud zones remain and use iCloud storage. Sync on devices using older versions will pause; each device must verify and restore the current library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成云库准备后，先确认保留旧本机资料的只读归档，再接入新云库。订阅、收藏和正文通过另行选择与隐私审阅复制；本机 AI 产物留在归档。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After preparing the cloud library, confirm retaining a read-only archive of old local data before adopting the new library. Subscriptions, stars and content are copied through a separate selection and privacy review. Local AI results stay in the archive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将继续之前已批准的新云库准备，沿用原操作及保留旧云资料的选择。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continue the previously approved preparation using its original operation and choice to retain old cloud data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我确认建立空的新云库，并已了解其他设备的同步与历史恢复影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I approve creating an empty replacement cloud library and understand the sync and history recovery effects on other devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我确认旧云资料继续保留，占用空间并需要另行处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I approve retaining old cloud data, its storage usage and handling it separately later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新云库已准备，旧本机范围保持保留。下一步核验只读归档与恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The new cloud library is prepared and the old local scope is retained. Next, review the read-only archive and recovery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核验阶段只读取控制信息。正式开始后会更新云库控制记录并建立空资料区；停止或关闭窗口不会撤销已完成的云端步骤，可再次核验并继续原操作。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verification only reads control metadata. Starting updates cloud control records and creates empty zones. Stopping or closing this window does not undo completed cloud steps. Verify again to continue the original operation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核验归档与恢复…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Review Archive and Recovery…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "继续已批准的准备" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continue Approved Preparation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始准备新云库" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prepare the New Cloud Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核验当前云库" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verify the Current Cloud Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留旧云资料并准备新云库…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep Old Cloud Data and Prepare a New Library…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请确认建立空的新云库及其他设备的同步影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirm creating an empty replacement cloud library and its effect on syncing other devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请确认旧云资料继续保留并占用 iCloud 空间。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirm retaining the previous cloud data and its iCloud storage usage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新云库准备预览已过期或账号范围已变化，请重新核验。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The new-library review expired or the account scope changed. Verify again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前范围不适用保留旧云资料的新云库准备，请先核对恢复进度。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This scope is not eligible for preparing a new library while retaining old cloud data. Review recovery progress first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前本机范围：订阅 %lld，文章 %lld，收藏 %lld。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Current local scope: %lld subscriptions, %lld articles, %lld stars."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端历史清理" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud History Cleanup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先核验并审阅本次有限范围。收藏、允许同步的未读正文、最近修改和本机待发送资料受保护；本机文章、阅读状态与 AI 资料保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verify and review a finite scope first. Stars, eligible unread content, recent changes and pending local data are protected. Articles, reading states and AI data on this Mac are retained."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史状态保留 183 天，每周最多处理 400 条云端记录，包括清理组的保护保存。清理可能减少其他设备能恢复的历史；之后新增的文章需要另行审阅。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Historical states are retained for 183 days. At most 400 cloud records are processed per week, including protection saves in cleanup groups. Cleanup may reduce history recoverable on other devices. Articles added later need a separate review."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我已审阅本次历史恢复与隐私影响，确认清理符合规则的云端记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I reviewed the history recovery and privacy effects and approve cleanup of eligible cloud records."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为避免本机时钟影响周配额，任务还会保存时间校验控制记录。这些额外控制写入不计入上述 400 条历史清理组额度，不删除正文或状态。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The task also saves time-verification control records so the device clock cannot renew the weekly quota. These extra control writes are outside the 400-record cleanup-group budget and do not delete content or states."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我单独同意本次任务的额外时间校验控制写入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I separately approve extra time-verification control writes for this task."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭窗口后，已批准任务仍可在后台进行。停止会保留具体阶段，已发出的云端请求需核验结果后才能继续。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Approved tasks can continue in the background after this window closes. Stopping retains their stage. The outcome of an already submitted cloud request must be verified before continuing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始本次清理" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start This Cleanup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取或继续核验候选" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read or Continue Verifying Candidates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止本次任务" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop This Task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "继续已批准任务" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continue the Approved Task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次核验时间：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Next verification:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分请求的结果或证据需要复核；保留原操作记录，暂不能替换为新任务。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some request outcomes or evidence need review. Their operation records are retained and cannot be replaced by a new task yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "审阅云端历史清理…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Review Cloud History Cleanup…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先审阅并确认本次云端历史清理的影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Review and confirm the effects of this cloud history cleanup first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请单独确认用于核验服务器时间的额外控制写入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Separately confirm the extra control writes used to verify server time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "候选核验尚未完成或达到统计上限，请继续读取或缩小范围。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
